From d661a74052811853a8881e4a3d59e549383021a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 20:53:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(sprite): hero redraw + constant 2-frame walk-cycle
 animation

Hero re-authored (blue cap/tunic, gold skin, black outline) with two walk
frames per facing; frame 1 lives at HERO_FRAME_OFF in pattern table 1.
BuildOAM toggles the frame from frame_count (every 8 frames while sliding
= one stride per 16px step; every 16 at rest), DQ-style always-animating.
---
 src/chr.s           |  39 ++++++---
 src/main.s          |  28 ++++++-
 src/tiles.inc       |   1 +
 tools/gen_assets.py | 189 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------------
 4 files changed, 181 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

